~ start
do! CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(5000,600), 0.75, 2.0, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Az: [shake level=7 rate=30]Ugh[/shake].[wait=0.2] [i]cough[/i]. [wait=0.2]Come on.
Fenn: [wave freq=7 amp=30]Hello again![/wave]
do CutsceneManager.npc_face("Az","left")
Az: Fenn?! [wait=0.2]What're you doing here? [wait=0.2][shake level=7 rate=30]I told you to stay behind![/shake]
Fenn: Adventure![wait=0.2] [wave freq=10 amp=40]I must [rainbow freq=0.1 speed=0.4]save the Knights[/rainbow]![/wave]
Az: Ugh, [wait=0.2]whatever.[wait=0.2] I guess you're already here.
do CutsceneManager.npc_face("Az","right")
Az: We've got bad news, though. [wait=0.2]Big ice wall in the way.
Fenn: Ooh! [wait=0.2]Is it fire breath time?!
do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(12000,100), 1.33, 3.0, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Az: Yeah I don't think so. 
do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(5000,600), 0.75, 2.0, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
do CutsceneManager.npc_face("Az","left")
Az: We need a way around. [wait=0.2]I [shake level=7 rate=30]need[/shake] to get to my [color="blue"]Workshop[/color].
Fenn: [color="blue"]Workshop[/color]?
Az: Yeah.[wait=0.2] [i]cough[/i] I need something from there. [wait=0.2]It's deeper in the cellar.[wait=0.2] Last thing I want is someone messing with my stuff.
Fenn: Huh...[wait=0.2] the [color="purple"]Wizard[/color] also said something about a [color="blue"]Workshop[/color].
Az: You ran into the [color="purple"][i]Wizard[/i][/color]?[wait=0.2] Are you okay?
Fenn: Yeah. [wait=0.2]He was scary. [wait=0.2][wave freq=7 amp=30]But also pretty cool.[/wave]
Az: [font_size=30]By the Sender.[/font_size][wait=0.2] Stay [shake level=7 rate=30]AWAY[/shake] from him, okay? 
Fenn: What if I go down there?
Az: The grate?
Fenn: We have to get out of here somehow.
Az: And if that Wizard gets his hands on my [color="blue"]Workshop[/color]...
Az: [font_size=30]Ugh, I hate this.[/font_size]
Az: [font_size=70][shake level=7 rate=30]FINE.[/shake][/font_size] You go down there, I'll find another way out of here.
Az: [i]cough[/i] And take one of these.
Az hands Fenn something
Fenn: A bracelet?
Az: A bangle. I should be able to use it to help you from afar.
Fenn: Should?
Az: Okay, [wait=0.2]I've never, uh, [wait=0.2]tried before. [wait=0.2]But it'll be fine.
Az: And Fenn, be [i]careful[/i], okay? [wait=0.2]You see anything dangerous, [wait=0.2]you get out. Got it?
Fenn: No promises!
Az: [shake level=7 rate=30]Ugh.[/shake] [wait=0.2]Nevermind.
do EventFlags.set_flag("Az-Stuck-Pantry", true)
=> END